# Allowlist: the build context is the repo root, and only what the images copy is sent to Docker.
# Anything new (an .env, a key, a dump) stays out of every image unless it is added here on purpose.
*
!backend/app
!backend/engine
!backend/requirements.txt
!legacy
!frontend
!deploy/Caddyfile
frontend/node_modules
frontend/dist
frontend/test-results
frontend/playwright-report
**/__pycache__
**/.env*
